TO SETUP DATABASE
You need to Have XAMPP and Create the DATABASE
To create the database needed just paste this into the sql query

CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS visitorlog_db;
USE visitorlog_db

after pasting you can import the visitorlog_db.sql using the import option,
but you can also do it manually.

to set up users table copy and paste this in the sql query:

CREATE TABLE `users` (
  `id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `username` varchar(100) NOT NULL,
  `password` varchar(255) NOT NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_general_ci;


to insert a user copy and paste this, for the username you can change it 
to your preferred user and for the password you can use the passHash.php
file for more info.

INSERT INTO `users` (`id`, `username`, `password`) VALUES
(2, 'admin', '$2y$10$rXQopgF2tZpn2wToRX0xAezfSsS6I6/PxlfeTuLHXG6Uf6DtgJewm');


To set up vusutirs table copy and paste this in the sql query:

CREATE TABLE `visitors` (
  `visitor_id` int(11) NOT NULL,
  `full_name` varchar(50) NOT NULL,
  `user_type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,
  `srcode` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,
  `contact` varchar(50) NOT NULL,
  `purpose` text DEFAULT NULL,
  `time_in` datetime DEFAULT current_timestamp(),
  `time_out` datetime DEFAULT NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci;